\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Futures: Mkt Cuts Dlr Shorts, But Unit Still Weak \b0\par\par\uc2  By Jamie McGeever \par \uc2 508 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Juli 2002\par 11:32\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par \par \uc2  LONDON -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market positioning from short-term accounts is becoming gradually less weighted against the dollar, according to figures from the U.S. futures markets. \par \par \uc2  But, in the current bearish dollar climate, this merely widens the scope for opening new short positions, observers say. \par \par \uc2  Speculative players remain heavily short of dollars, which should limit the pace of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decline, but these positions are being slowly wound down. \par \par \uc2  That doesn't, however, appear to be giving much help to the dollar, which is grinding down to new multi-month and multi-year lows against its major counterparts, suggesting the presence of real money flows. \par \par \uc2  The trend for the dollar appears still to be downward, and if the unwinding of speculative positions fails to trigger a bounce, the greenback is likely to come under renewed pressure. \par \par \uc2  In the week ending July 9, dealers on the International Monetary Market at the Chicago Mercantile Exchange trimmed their net long euro, sterling, Canadian dollar and Swiss franc positions, but moderately increased their net long yen positions. \par \par \uc2  In the same week, however, the dollar fell to a new 27-month low against the pound, a 10-month low against the yen and remained weak against the euro and Swiss franc. \par \par \uc2  Parity with the single European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains on the cards and the market expects \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  at any time to prop up the dollar. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par               Cable Climbs Above $1.55\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the week to July 9, IMM dealers cut their net long euro positions\par to 24,082 contracts from 24,359 a week earlier.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Analysts at Citibank say this level of positioning "is a major\par impediment" to the euro breaking through parity and, clearly, there is\par room for further unwinding.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But these levels are well down from the record 35,000 contracts a few\par months ago, and anecdotal evidence suggests they have since been wound\par down since July 9.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "Current positioning is not particularly extreme, but is probably\par sufficient to slow (euro/dollar's) upside progress," wrote ABN Amro's\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  research team in a note Monday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Canadian dollar net longs were cut to 22,316 contracts from 23,412 a\par week earlier. But this is still considered to be extreme positioning,\par and, along with the removal of two Canadian companies from the S&P500\par index last week, should support the U.S. unit against the "loonie".\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par IMM dealers cut their net long sterling positions to a negligible\par 1,916 contracts from 2,229, leaving the way open to lift sterling even\par higher.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Last week, the U.K. pound hit a 27-month high of $1.5499. It's since\par climbed to $1.5581.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Net short Swiss franc positions were shaved back to 12,398 contracts\par from 13,173, while net long yen positions were increased to 10,200\par contracts from 9,046.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Jamie McGeever, Dow Jones Newswires; 44 207 842 9483;\par jamie.mcgeever@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020715dy7f000j7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
