\par\par \b \uc2  With Dollar Weak Versus Yen, `Break-Even' Level Is Eyed \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tyler Lifton \par \uc2 708 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juli 2002\par 21:48\par \uc2  Dow Jones Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par \par \uc2  NEW YORK -(Dow Jones)- The yen's current range versus the  dollar will hamper the spread of Japan's tentative, export-led recovery to its domestic sector, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  professionals believe, but can't agree on the importance of the yen's so-called "break-even" level below which the country's exporters can't make a profit. \par \par \uc2  According to the most recent Cabinet Office survey of non-financial listed companies, a dollar level of Y115.32 or  lower would result in unprofitability for exporters, Citibank strategists wrote in a report Friday. \par \par \uc2  "With the recovery in Japan heavily export driven, the recent sharp appreciation of the yen is likely sowing the seeds of a future slowdown," the report states. \par \par \uc2  The "break-even" issue is a major concern for \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market professionals because Japanese monetary authorities are prone to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in markets to slow the yen's appreciation. Since late May, the Bank of Japan has made seven forays into \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. However, recent statements by Japanese officials have muddled the market's understanding of the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy. \par \par \uc2  Earlier Friday, finance minister Masajuro Shiokawa said "Recent \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements appear to be somewhat smaller than those seen some two weeks ago." \par \par \uc2  Steven Saywell, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist for Citibank in London said of Shiokawa's statement, "The market's a little bit confused by that because he's almost saying the dollar/yen can fall as long as it's slow and steady." \par \par \uc2  Despite this confusion, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  pros assert that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again, though at lower levels than many had previously forecast. Indeed, the yen has spent most of the week in a range well below its seven previous \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    How Long Must We Sing This Song?\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But while it's important to be cognizant of the yen's break-even level\par due to the importance it holds for Japanese  officials, it's equally\par important not to be too myopic about it, Citibank's Saywell said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par More important is to monitor how long the yen will remain in its\par current range, he said. The longer it does, "the less and less there's a\par chance of the recovery spreading to the domestic sector" in Japan,\par Saywell said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Taking it one step further, Tim Stewart, chief \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist for\par Morgan Stanley, said he pays little attention  to the break-even level.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "What does a break-even point mean?" he said, noting that there are\par many factors on which profitability depends. "There are plenty of\par exporters for whom it depends on what (their) market share is,"\par companies that may tolerate losses now in order to build up for future\par profitability, for instance, Stewart said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "My sense is that what the Japanese are concerned about, why the (yen)\par 115 number keeps cropping up," is not because that number is important\par unto itself, but rather because if the dollar reaches that level, it\par could spark a bigger fall in the greenback, Stewart said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "People are now talking about the possibility for (the dollar to\par reach) 113 or 114" yen, he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Shiokawa has twice in the past eight days said that the dollar could\par fall to its post Sept. 11 low, Y115.80, statements many traders took to\par mean that \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  won't \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  until the dollar reaches that\par approximate level.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Meanwhile, market professionals have been hypothesizing about ways\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Ministry of Finance\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , which oversees \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , could improve\par the efficacy of its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , which have done little of late to\par stem the tide of the falling greenback.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par During its latest \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , on June 28, the MOF gave  the market a\par taste of something different, asking the Federal Reserve and the\par European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on its behalf for the first time this\par year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par And it may turn its sights next to interest rates to further its\par cause, Citibank's Saywell believes.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "Yen \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is much more effective when it's accompanied by\par monetary easing," he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "Certainly the longer then yen remains at these levels,  it does\par increase the need for the Bank of Japan to ease monetary policy."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -Tyler Lifton; Dow Jones Newswires; 201 938 2248;\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -tyler.lifton@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020020712dy7c00ct5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
