\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dollar eyes 10-month lows vs yen, Shiokawa puzzles. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Carolyn Cohn \par \uc2 538 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juli 2002\par 09:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, July 12 (Reuters) - The dollar hovered near the previous day's 10-month lows against the yen on Friday as comments from Japanese Finance Minister Masajuro Shiokawa left the impression that yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not imminent. \par \par \uc2  Shiokawa told a news conference that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  would act against excessive volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, but that the dollar's decline against the yen seemed to be less rapid than two weeks earlier. \par \par \uc2  Concern about the performance of U.S. assets has hit the dollar in recent months, but the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has found some support from the threat of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , following Japanese action on at least seven days since late May. \par \par \uc2  "The jawboning continues, but the markets are nervously awaiting the real business of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said David Bloom, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at HSBC Markets. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was at 116.79/84 yen at 0737 GMT, around 0.20 percent down from late New York trade, and from Thursday's low of 116.41. \par \par \uc2  The euro was trading at $0.9890/93, little changed from late U.S. trade. \par \par \uc2  The dollar found some support against the euro after Dell Computer Corp revised up its second-quarter earnings outlook in after-hours trading. \par \par \uc2  The Nasdaq index closed 2.11 percent higher on Thursday, following heavy losses in the prevous session, and Nasdaq futures were trading strongly in European trade. \par \par \uc2  The single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was trading around 115.49/52 yen, above six-week lows around 115.20 set on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that exporters' needs to buy yen for euros indirectly weighed on the euro against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Euro zone finance ministers and representatives of the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and European Commission issued a rare joint statement on Thursday, welcoming the euro's rise. \par \par \uc2  The finance ministers are meeting on Friday in Brussels. \par \par \uc2  WHAT DID HE MEAN? \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that despite Shiokawa's remarks, operators still consider the dollar's fall in the past two weeks rather large, with it slipping more than three percent over the period. \par \par \uc2  "Obviously, Shiokawa's comments didn't help the dollar but gave more excuses to sell dollars and also forced short-position holders to retain their positions," said Takashi Toyahara, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  section manager at Nomura Securities in Tokyo. \par \par \uc2  Asked if the dollar's latest slide to new 10-month lows below 117 yen would be considered volatile, Shiokawa said: "About two weeks ago, it moved a lot in a short period of time. It seems a little different now. \par \par \uc2  "If you look at the charts, the changes seem to be smaller. We want to keep an eye on it for a while." \par \par \uc2  WATCHING DATA \par \par \uc2  The market will be watching for U.S. retail sales data for June due later in the day but traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was likely to take its cue from the reaction on Wall Street. \par \par \uc2  Economists polled by Reuters on average expect sales to rise 0.7 percent overall and 0.5 percent excluding autos, erasing most of the previous month's losses. \par \par \uc2  The preliminary University of Michigan consumer sentiment index for July is expected to rise to 92.8 from the previous 92.4. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020712dy7c00fwa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
