\par\par \b \uc2  Japan says firm yuan reflects China's WTO entry. \b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Juli 2002\par 05:31\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, July 9 (Reuters) - Japanese Finance Minister Masajuro Shiokawa said on Tuesday that the recent firmness of China's yuan was a reflection of its entry to the World Trade Organisation (WTO) and the Asian giant's commitment to free trade. \par \par \uc2  "China is putting efforts into adapting itself to the WTO regime, and I think that is being reflected in the markets," Shiokawa told a parliamentary committee. \par \par \uc2  Since the start of this year, the yuan has moved mainly around 8.2770 to the U.S. dollar, near the strong end of the thin 8.2760-8.2800 range generally enforced by China's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  China has said it would widen the band to cope with changes in its balance of payments following entry into the WTO last December, but officials have given no timetable. \par \par \uc2  Trade is key to movement of the yuan, which is fully convertible only under the current account. \par \par \uc2  Shiokawa was responding to an opposition lawmaker who suggested that Tokyo call on Beijing to raise the value of its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , saying that it was presently undervalued. \par \par \uc2  Views that the yuan is undervalued are strong within corporate Japan as the weak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  gives Chinese exports an edge over those from \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Shiokawa said he would not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in China's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, but added: "We hope that China maintains a free and open \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime." \par \par \uc2  The yuan was trading at around 8.2766 to the U.S. dollar on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020709dy79006hd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
